# spec: site-kit/SPEC.md §Layout and configuration — this repo's site-kit consumer knob file

# comment-tier-exempt: these are this repo's own project host aliases — rule content the provenance seam bars a kit gate from carrying, so it lives here in consumer config; the docs/CNAME host equals the first entry and is skipped at compare, the rest are reachable hosts that must never be the cited docs URL
SITE_KIT_ALIASES[] = checkwright.dev
SITE_KIT_ALIASES[] = www.checkwright.dev
SITE_KIT_ALIASES[] = checkwright.com
SITE_KIT_ALIASES[] = www.checkwright.com
SITE_KIT_ALIASES[] = checkwright.github.io

# spec: site-kit/SPEC.md §check-docs-highlight-coverage — this repo's snapshot of the classes the Pages theme's highlight CSS colours, which the site-health theme-drift arm holds to the live stylesheet
SITE_KIT_HIGHLIGHT_TOKENS = scripts/highlight-tokens.list
